(6654779, 994821, 142473, '<td valign="top">The softness of this image is really cool.  Almost looks like a tilt shift image of a large clock, but the rough surface of rim kinda explains otherwise.<br/> <br/>Really neat.  Upon my first perusal of the entries, this is one of my top 5.</td>', 'The softness of this image is really cool.  Almost looks like a tilt shift image of a large clock, but the rough surface of rim kinda explains otherwise. Really neat.  Upon my first perusal of the entries, this is one of my top 5.', '2012-01-25 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
