(6654840, 994752, 143086, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up. Nice and clean.<br/> <br/>I think the tear is a hair out of focus though (pun intended...please forgive me and everyone else who couldn''t resist). The skin under the eye is in focus though, which is distracting. Perhaps the pink field is a bit too expansive.</td>', 'Nicely set up. Nice and clean. I think the tear is a hair out of focus though (pun intended...please forgive me and everyone else who couldn''t resist). The skin under the eye is in focus though, which is distracting. Perhaps the pink field is a bit too expansive.', '2012-01-25 13:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
