(6655578, 994182, 132251, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, interesting. I can''t tell if this bulb was <i>on</i> and you shot it extremely UE so it wasn''t washed out or if you cast light onto it from an external source. <br/> <br/>That gets me thinking as if the bulb was on, then a super high f/stop would be required and that would subsequently increase your DOF which is usually good for macro. <br/> <br/>Either way, cool shot. Maybe just dust if off next time.</td>', 'Hmmm, interesting. I can''t tell if this bulb was on and you shot it extremely UE so it wasn''t washed out or if you cast light onto it from an external source.  That gets me thinking as if the bulb was on, then a super high f/stop would be required and that would subsequently increase your DOF which is usually good for macro.  Either way, cool shot. Maybe just dust if off next time.', '2012-01-26 13:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
