(6660446, 994327, 81362, '<td valign="top">You might take some consolation that last place receives an informal designation as "brown ribbon", received with pride by a number of contrarians and delibertely sought by a few. Search the forum threads for that topic when you''d like a little entertainment. Generally, images that don''t seem to fit the challenge topic receive low votes, regarless of the artistic merits. Yours would have done well in an action shot challenge, and probably middle of the pack if entered in the monthly free study. Keep on participating -- nowhere to go but up. See that you''ve recently registered and this is your first challenge submission. Welcome to DPC.</td>', 'You might take some consolation that last place receives an informal designation as "brown ribbon", received with pride by a number of contrarians and delibertely sought by a few. Search the forum threads for that topic when you''d like a little entertainment. Generally, images that don''t seem to fit the challenge topic receive low votes, regarless of the artistic merits. Yours would have done well in an action shot challenge, and probably middle of the pack if entered in the monthly free study. Keep on participating -- nowhere to go but up. See that you''ve recently registered and this is your first challenge submission. Welcome to DPC.', '2012-02-01 06:26:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6660449, 994893, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superb, especially for basic. The extra 4Mp''s on the D7000 over the 12Mp bodies seem to make a difference when NOT Post Processing wildly. Fabulous compo, colours, contrast, and photographic ability.</td>', 'Superb, especially for basic. The extra 4Mp''s on the D7000 over the 12Mp bodies seem to make a difference when NOT Post Processing wildly. Fabulous compo, colours, contrast, and photographic ability.', '2012-02-01 06:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6660452, 993596, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great job! No stopping now!</td>', 'Great job! No stopping now!', '2012-02-01 06:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6660462, 994834, 19825, '<td valign="top">You are such a versatile photographer -- you cannot be pigeon holed (or squirrel holed). Beautiful shot. Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'You are such a versatile photographer -- you cannot be pigeon holed (or squirrel holed). Beautiful shot. Congratulations on the blue.', '2012-02-01 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6660464, 994715, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice finish</td>', 'Nice finish', '2012-02-01 07:21:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6660465, 994865, 118039, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I would score this higher if I thought this wasn''t a picture of a picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This was not picture of a picture.... Its a picture of my daughter as I see inside 3 glass marbles which I kept on a fork..my daughter is sitting on the other side..<br/> <br/>I turned the final image vertical which probably was not a good decision.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I would score this higher if I thought this wasn''t a picture of a picture.   This was not picture of a picture.... Its a picture of my daughter as I see inside 3 glass marbles which I kept on a fork..my daughter is sitting on the other side.. I turned the final image vertical which probably was not a good decision.', '2012-02-01 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
