(6661984, 994327, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ouch...I can see how this, being your first entry in DPC...must have been a bit of a downer.  But, as bob350 has explained...you''ll get used to the routine in here and I''m sure...do well.  Congrats on your first ribbon....The Coveted Brown Ribbon.  Lots of people have tried to get one.  I have a couple. :)  Now...you can move up and onwards.  :)</td>', 'Ouch...I can see how this, being your first entry in DPC...must have been a bit of a downer.  But, as bob350 has explained...you''ll get used to the routine in here and I''m sure...do well.  Congrats on your first ribbon....The Coveted Brown Ribbon.  Lots of people have tried to get one.  I have a couple. :)  Now...you can move up and onwards.  :)', '2012-02-02 13:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
