(6662991, 994700, 143086, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first challenge Magiclunia. This was my first challenge as well and so my commenting skills are just developing. My comment arose from a personal reaction that you would have had no way of predicting. So please don''t let it affect you too much. It''s a very good photograph with spot-on DOF and nice detail. I''m looking forward to seeing more of your photographs in the challenges!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first challenge Magiclunia. This was my first challenge as well and so my commenting skills are just developing. My comment arose from a personal reaction that you would have had no way of predicting. So please don''t let it affect you too much. It''s a very good photograph with spot-on DOF and nice detail. I''m looking forward to seeing more of your photographs in the challenges!', '2012-02-03 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
